OL,3,GNEWSAAccess to Cairn Gorm's summit from
OL,4,Afunicular allowed under trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople have been permitted to walk to
OL,7,Fthe summit of Cairn Gorm from the top
OL,8,Fstation of the mountain's funicular
OL,9,Frailway under a trial scheme.
OL,11,FUntil now, the access was not allowed
OL,12,Foutside the winter snowsports season,
OL,13,Funless visitors were accompanied by a
OL,14,Fguide.
OL,16,FThe restriction was put in place to
OL,17,Fprotect fragile habitats on the 4,085ft
OL,18,F(1,245m) summit of the UK's sixth
OL,19,Fhighest mountain.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
