OL,3,GNEWSAAccess to Cairn Gorm's summit from
OL,4,Afunicular allowed under trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FPermission has been given for a trial
OL,7,Funtil 30 November, and visitors will be
OL,8,Fasked to keep to paths while carrying
OL,9,FGPS handsets to check they remain
OL,10,Fwithin an "approved zone" in the
OL,11,Fmountain's ski area.
